msgid "So... Anything new regarding Gatling Sendo?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"He's supposed to be at the MEB Info Center. Do you think you\r\n"
"could go talk to him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "Oh, Kiryu-san! Thanks for stopping by."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "So... Anything new regarding the weapons fanatic?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid ""
"He's supposed to be near the bikini bar on Pink Street.\r\n"
"Could you go meet with him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
