msgid "Oh, Kiryu-san! Thanks for stopping by."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "So... Anything new regarding Iwakuma?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid ""
"I heard he was causing a ruckus in front of the nabe place\r\n"
"on Shichifuku Street. Could you go see him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "Oh, Kiryu-san! Thanks for stopping by."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "So... So, anything new regarding Violence Tobita?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid ""
"He's supposed to be drinking somewhere in the\r\n"
"Champion District. Could you go talk to him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "Oh, Kiryu-san! Thanks for stopping by."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid ""
"I'll send you a message if I find someone suitable to recruit\r\n"
"as a bouncer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "Until then, enjoy the casino."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "Oh, perfect timing, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid ""
"I know we already owe you so much, but would you reconsider\r\n"
"scouting some bouncers for us?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid ""
"Sorry... But I'm gonna have to bounce on this one. As in,\r\n"
"I can't help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid ""
"I see... Well, if you ever change your mind and want to help,\r\n"
"please come see me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "It's a deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "All right. I'll see if I can round up a few bouncers for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid ""
"Thank you! I really feel bad asking you to do this, though.\r\n"
"You've done so much for us already..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid "It's no problem. So who do you want me to start with?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid ""
"There's a pro wrestler who goes by the name of\r\n"
"Violence Tobita who might work out. Try him first."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid ""
"I heard he hurt his back and was tossed out of the wrestling\r\n"
"federation, though Tobita still prowls around on his own,\r\n"
"claiming he can fight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "\"Violence\" Tobita, huh? Where can I find him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid ""
"I heard someone say they saw him drinking somewhere around\r\n"
"the Champion District."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid "Got it. Wonder if he really lives up to that name..."
msgstr ""

